1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:01,389
This card has

2
00:00:01,389 --> 00:00:02,283
no battery. No

3
00:00:02,283 --> 00:00:03,718
charger. Nothing inside.

4
00:00:03,718 --> 00:00:04,449
So how does

5
00:00:04,449 --> 00:00:04,937
it pay?

6
00:00:05,627 --> 00:00:06,314
Flip it open

7
00:00:06,314 --> 00:00:07,001
and there is

8
00:00:07,001 --> 00:00:07,830
no power source

9
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:08,517
at all. Just

10
00:00:08,517 --> 00:00:09,157
a chip, and

11
00:00:09,157 --> 00:00:09,938
this, a copper

12
00:00:09,938 --> 00:00:10,910
wire looped around

13
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:11,786
the edge, hidden

14
00:00:11,786 --> 00:00:12,805
inside the plastic.

15
00:00:13,495 --> 00:00:14,188
That loop is

16
00:00:14,188 --> 00:00:15,025
an antenna. And

17
00:00:15,025 --> 00:00:16,100
the payment terminal

18
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,271
is constantly blasting

19
00:00:17,271 --> 00:00:18,156
out an invisible

20
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:18,825
radio field.

21
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:20,443
The moment your

22
00:00:20,443 --> 00:00:21,424
card enters that

23
00:00:21,424 --> 00:00:22,352
field, the loop

24
00:00:22,352 --> 00:00:23,227
catches it and

25
00:00:23,227 --> 00:00:24,420
literally steals its

26
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,401
power. The field

27
00:00:25,401 --> 00:00:26,488
itself charges the

28
00:00:26,488 --> 00:00:27,681
chip. Wirelessly. In

29
00:00:27,681 --> 00:00:28,450
milliseconds.

30
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,035
Powered up, the

31
00:00:30,035 --> 00:00:31,032
chip wakes, talks

32
00:00:31,032 --> 00:00:31,978
to the terminal,

33
00:00:31,978 --> 00:00:32,924
fires a one-time

34
00:00:32,924 --> 00:00:34,024
code, approves your

35
00:00:34,024 --> 00:00:35,021
coffee, and then,

36
00:00:35,021 --> 00:00:35,865
it dies again.

37
00:00:36,555 --> 00:00:37,308
So your card

38
00:00:37,308 --> 00:00:38,165
isn't dead. It

39
00:00:38,165 --> 00:00:39,230
just sleeps, until

40
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,243
the machine wakes

41
00:00:40,243 --> 00:00:40,996
it. Which is

42
00:00:40,996 --> 00:00:41,749
why it needs

43
00:00:41,749 --> 00:00:42,606
no battery. No

44
00:00:42,606 --> 00:00:43,593
charger. Nothing.

